<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed lower in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 576.87, off 2.16.</p>
<p>Losers beat gainers 306 to 219.</p>
<p>The average price per share was off $0.05.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 19,126,300, compared with 18,952,100 Friday.</p>
<p>	  (Prices official as of 1645 EDT/2045 GMT)</p>
</text>
